{"role":"tool","content":"    1\t{\"meta\":true,\"id\":\"20260916-033018qnfv\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\",\"model\":\"freellmapi/auto\",\"title\":\"subagent: Open xlsx in Excel app\",\"createdAt\":1789509618.024,\"compactedFrom\":55,\"usage\":{\"in\":1576062,\"out\":8224,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0},\"digest\":\"\",\"turnMarks\":[]}\n    2\t{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"You need to read the Excel file at D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\\\\data\\\\7cc4acfa-63fd-4acc-a1a1-e8e529e0a97f.xlsx and report all its data.\\n\\nThe bash tool is not working (permission denied). So use the COMPUTER TOOL instead:\\n\\n1. Use computer tool with action \\\"launch\\\" and app pointing to Excel or the file itself. Try launching: \\\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\\\\data\\\\7cc4acfa-63fd-4acc-a1a1-e8e529e0a97f.xlsx\\\"\\n\\n2. After it opens, use computer tool with action \\\"screenshot\\\" to see the contents, and read all the data.\\n\\n3. Report every single cell value you can see.\\n\\nThe file is about sales of menu items for a regional fast-food chain. You need to determine total sales for Wharvton vs Algrimand cities.\\n\\nDo NOT summarize. Give me every row of data you can see.\"}\n    3\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"I'll try to read the Excel file using Python since the bash tool may still work for python commands. Let me attempt to load and parse the data.\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_f0914622865c4a5890f5ec1e\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"cd D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia && python -c \\\"import openpyxl; print('openpyxl available')\\\" 2>&1 || python3 -c \\\"import openpyxl; print('openpyxl available')\\\" 2>&1\",\"timeout\":15}}]}\n    4\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for bash\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_f0914622865c4a5890f5ec1e\",\"name\":\"bash\"}\n    5\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"The bash tool is indeed blocked. Let me try reading the file directly and also attempt to capture the screen\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_72436bef040d475aaa03e7cd\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\\\\data\\\\7cc4acfa-63fd-4acc-a1a1-e8e529e0a97f.xlsx\"}},{\"id\":\"call_fdbeada7cf8a424ea1ec4cf0\",\"name\":\"screenshot\",\"arguments\":{}}]}\n... [79 more lines]","toolCallId":"call_61aea1c523f342279ac5dc03","name":"read"}
